# Repository instructions (fallback for agents without Agent Skills support)

## Deep research / comparison / rebuild tasks

1. Read `.agents/skills/exhaustive-research-decision-v6/SKILL.md` first and follow its G1-G9 guardrails.
2. Do not invent a new methodology, format or framework before `reuse-decision.md`. Prefer adopt / adapt / extend / compose of existing solutions with proven use.
3. Materialise interim artifacts as real files under `research/<task-id>/` using `assets/templates/`; never keep them only in chat.
4. Reference artifacts by `path + hash + stable_id`, not by chat section numbers.
5. Build one `criteria.csv` (brief + domain_standard + candidate_union + synthetic), separate `unknown / n/a / not_supported / 0`, and give every synthetic metric a formula plus sensitivity.
6. Fill the complete candidate x criterion matrix; run a second research pass for missing cells.
7. Run `python3 .agents/skills/exhaustive-research-decision-v6/scripts/check_gates.py research/<task-id>` before claiming PASS.
8. Keep `residual_unknowns`; never claim absolute completeness or zero errors. In high-risk domains produce a dossier and human gate, not a diagnosis or work authorisation.

If this repository uses a different skills directory, replace the path above accordingly.
